  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPREhQQTJ6T1M4cmdyMzU2SUhaYWszWDZOOWp0TzJ1M240RnY3RjI4OEpCQmlHR0pFbU1FekdXMXE1dzVjVHJlZ2ZMUjdOYXZIem5JY01DQ3JyYnIyUWxnZWNoR25TTG9DdExHNjNGMTdSNzJLZ3pKQ0JJeWxzMjV5cUlid3JkR0czV3ZmWlRnWXZ5QVBaSFJYZmltaU1Caks4NkdPTHo2bjE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bitcoin price analysis: BTC continues to decline Saturday, entering &#x27;deep value zone&#x27;</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/13/kraken-parent-payward-says-expansion-outside-crypto-trading-helps-cushion-revenue-decline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kraken parent Payward says expansion outside crypto trading helps cushion revenue decline</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/adam-back-simpler-security-blockstream-bitcoin-custody-system?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Adam Back makes case for simpler security as Blockstream launches Bitcoin custody system</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
